{"page":20098,"part":1,"text":"朱长文\n\n\n朱长文（一〇三九年—一〇九八年），宋代书法家。字伯原，自号灊溪隐夫。吴县（今属江苏）人。未冠举进士，著书不仕，名动京师。元祐中召为太学博士，迁秘书省正字。元符初卒。《六经》皆有辩说，又著《吴郡图经续记》、《琴台志》、《乐圃馀稿》和《墨池编》等书。\n\n\n《续书断》一文选自《墨池编》第九、第十卷，《墨池编》一书是朱长文选辑的历代书法论文汇编，而其中《续书断》一篇是他自己的著作，继唐张怀瓘《书断》之后，仿其体例，继续把唐宋时期的书家，按上、中、下（神、妙、能）三品，一一评论，以补《书断》之缺。\n\n\n续书断\n","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20098,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"970b4e75c94b921c05e5bd9f8fdca7e1e0c128f297c5878208e1e85c3fcabb35","textSha256":"970b4e75c94b921c05e5bd9f8fdca7e1e0c128f297c5878208e1e85c3fcabb35","fileSha256":"970b4e75c94b921c05e5bd9f8fdca7e1e0c128f297c5878208e1e85c3fcabb35","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20098-work-109.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"续书断 · 题解与篇首","sourceUrl":"","originalPages":[329],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":4,"sourceTextSha256":"9720b4fa2d4c515c90c982f54c594b948b96e882792b26ab95a9574a979b110c","id":"local-329-0-10","page_id":329,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":10,"reviewedTextSha256":"502e43ef72df579b14c2454ad1e1cd20b528d2ebc9c3a839239be7ec99de6024","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8],[8,9],[9,10]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":329,"part":2,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"郑雨荻","verifiedAt":"2026-10-19T02:34:28.423Z","revision":"502e43ef72df579b14c2454ad1e1cd20b528d2ebc9c3a839239be7ec99de6024","textSha256":"502e43ef72df579b14c2454ad1e1cd20b528d2ebc9c3a839239be7ec99de6024","fileSha256":"a7959b8ad3ac4b1328d4afcc5960761834bc9dbc83e2ea2d0c51808b9658a61c","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-2-part-2/第2份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":6,"en